  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building inclusive, effective strategies for intact forest conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WCS is advocating for recognition of a package of linked policy and finance guidance at the international scale for intact forest protection. WCS will work with national institutions on options for building concrete, investable plans to increase ambition around intact forests. Candidate countries are DRC, Indonesia, Colombia, Bhutan, Suriname, Republic of Congo, Peru, Ecuador, Myanmar, and the Mesoamerican countries leading the 5 Great Forests Initiative coordinated by CCAD (CR, PA, GT, HN).</narrative>
  </description>
